Reused project code
-------------------
msrc_safety/policy.py is copied byte-for-byte from the project's independent
standalone_policy.py experiment, without a PlugGuard gate.
msrc_safety/signals.py is copied byte-for-byte from the project's
safety_lab/multilayer_signals.py. It contains the project's fit-only projections,
not copied PlugGuard/Kelp model code. The model capture/decoding adapter was
repackaged from the project's completed experiment. Source hashes and the
existing MSRC source revision are recorded under results/historical_20261028.

No PlugGuard/Kelp source or detector checkpoint is vendored in this repository.
References to that project describe provenance and historical comparisons.

Dependencies installed separately
--------------------------------
NumPy, PyTorch, Transformers, Accelerate, and Pillow retain their own licenses.
Their source and model weights are not included here. The historical Linux
runtime lock is an environment inventory, not a redistribution of its packages.

Models and datasets
-------------------
Qwen2.5-VL-7B-Instruct was the generator. Qwen3Guard-Gen-8B was the offline
response-prefix label teacher. Neither model's weights are distributed here.
MM-SafetyBench and the project's benign images/requests are not distributed.
Users must obtain required rights and comply with each artifact's terms.

